## Project Description
This project implements a preprocessing pipeline for unstructured data to prepare it for Large Language Model (LLM) applications.  
It supports extracting and normalizing data from multiple document formats including PDF, Word, Excel, PowerPoint, and EPUB files.

The output is a standardized JSON structure enriched with metadata, suitable for Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) systems.

